{"parse": {"title": "流行于世界-04", "pageid": 147079, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B5%81%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C-03\" title=\"流行于世界-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">流行于世界-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B5%81%E8%A1%8C%E4%BA%8E%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C-05\" title=\"流行于世界-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">流行于世界</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AE.9E.E5.9C.B0.E8.80.83.E5.AF.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"实地考察\">实地考察</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 实地考察</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3054_level_6.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3054 level 6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/Rolestory_3054_level_6.png/200px-Rolestory_3054_level_6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"134\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/Rolestory_3054_level_6.png/300px-Rolestory_3054_level_6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/Rolestory_3054_level_6.png/400px-Rolestory_3054_level_6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"432\" data-file-height=\"289\" /></a></div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">09:21 圣洛夫基金会·纽约办事处</span></div>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3054_gamepic_09.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3054 gamepic 09.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Rolestory_3054_gamepic_09.png/110px-Rolestory_3054_gamepic_09.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"120\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Rolestory_3054_gamepic_09.png/165px-Rolestory_3054_gamepic_09.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Rolestory_3054_gamepic_09.png/220px-Rolestory_3054_gamepic_09.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"496\" data-file-height=\"540\" /></a><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">圣洛夫基金会·纽约办事处</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>基金会职员Ⅰ：</b></span>“小姐，请在这里稍等，面试官很快就会到达。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“好。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>身着灰白格子制服的职员踩着高跟鞋，离开了这个地方。<br />\n等脚步声消失在走廊的尽头，记者立刻猫起腰，以尽量轻巧的步伐移动。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“当务之急：找出圣洛夫基金会的违规证据——他们向民众隐藏了某种关键性的真相，我们目前仍未得知其真实目的，但一定有一个阴谋。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“我们的第一步应该是……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first style-choice\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"前往档案室\">前往档案室</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"发展线人\">发展线人</div></div>\n<div>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"前往档案室\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“没错，我们应该前往档案室——那里汇集了最为重要的信息。在所有的时代里，信息都是最重要的资源。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“只要能突破那个地方，一切事情都会变得顺理成章。”<br />\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"发展线人\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“贸然前往档案室，是一种鲁莽的行为。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“我们应该尽快地发展一名线人。一定有无数的人正在遭受压迫，他们只是缺乏一个发声的渠道。”<br />\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<p>楼道的尽头传来了隐约的脚步声，有人要来了。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first style-choice\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"离开此地\">离开此地</div></div>\n<div></div></div>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>洋葱头把一条灰白色格子的领巾系在了脖子上，尽量让自己在这群灰白格子中不那么显眼。<br />\n趁一个职员刷开大门的时候，记者借机进入了内部办公区域。<br />\n没有人对此表示疑义——即使在纪律森严的基金会内部，忘带工卡也是一件常见的事。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3054_gamepic_10.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3054 gamepic 10.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Rolestory_3054_gamepic_10.png/110px-Rolestory_3054_gamepic_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"100\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Rolestory_3054_gamepic_10.png/165px-Rolestory_3054_gamepic_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Rolestory_3054_gamepic_10.png/220px-Rolestory_3054_gamepic_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"487\" data-file-height=\"444\" /></a><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“接下来……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first style-choice\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"办公室内传来激烈的争吵声\">办公室内传来激烈的争吵声</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"远处的柱子下方，有人正在打电话\">远处的柱子下方，有人正在打电话</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"路边有一本遗落的笔记\">路边有一本遗落的笔记</div></div>\n<div>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"办公室内传来激烈的争吵声\">\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>记者向着噪音的来源走去。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3054_gamepic_06.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3054 gamepic 06.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Rolestory_3054_gamepic_06.png/110px-Rolestory_3054_gamepic_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"122\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Rolestory_3054_gamepic_06.png/165px-Rolestory_3054_gamepic_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Rolestory_3054_gamepic_06.png/220px-Rolestory_3054_gamepic_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"470\" data-file-height=\"520\" /></a><br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>基金会职员Ⅱ：</b></span>“鲍勃，隔壁部门投诉你了，说你的汇报资料提交得太晚，严重影响了下游工作。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>鲍勃：</b></span>“按道理说，我现在应该正在享受我的带薪年假！”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>鲍勃：</b></span>“更何况那根本不是我们部门的工作——该死，隔壁战略传播科到底什么时候才能招到新的新闻干事？我不想再额外负担那些工作了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>基金会职员Ⅱ：</b></span>“谁让你是斯坦福大学的传播学硕士呢？学历达标，专业对口。鲍勃，工作只会流向那些擅长工作的人——下次别再那么能干了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>基金会职员Ⅱ：</b></span>“美利坚不是每个地方都有工会的。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>鲍勃：</b></span>“……”<br />\n<small style=\"color: #999;\">获取线索</small><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable center\" style=\"max-width:800px\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">基金会的裂痕<small>（线索5）</small>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>圣洛夫基金会具有精准、严格的用人标准，确保每位职员都能充分发挥自己的专业特长，让工作效率最大化。\n</td>\n<td>基金会对内执行高压工作标准，职权模糊、加班严重、部门间冲突等问题频发。目前，有职员正在筹划罢工。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>没有更多的声音了，记者离开了此地。<br />\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"远处的柱子下方，有人正在打电话\">\n<p>记者蹑手蹑脚地凑近了声音的来源。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女士：</b></span>“第一防线学校失踪的学生还没有找到吗？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3054_gamepic_07.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3054 gamepic 07.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/Rolestory_3054_gamepic_07.png/110px-Rolestory_3054_gamepic_07.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"104\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/Rolestory_3054_gamepic_07.png/165px-Rolestory_3054_gamepic_07.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/Rolestory_3054_gamepic_07.png/220px-Rolestory_3054_gamepic_07.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"470\" data-file-height=\"444\" /></a><br />\n她的声音十分焦急。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女士：</b></span>“在那件事情之后，我们已经修改了一部分条例，以尽量宽松、人性化的方式去对待那些学生。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女士：</b></span>“如果怀柔手段没有效果，那只能恢复之前的条例了——康斯坦丁女士的决定是正确的，我不应该质疑她。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女士：</b></span>“不必担心，先生，我会承担那些可能的负面后果。现在最紧急的事情，就是找到那名失踪的学生。”<br />\n<small style=\"color: #999;\">获取线索</small><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable center\" style=\"max-width:800px\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">失踪的学生<small>（线索6）</small>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第一防线学校有学生失踪，疑似与高压管理政策相关。校方正在采取行动。\n</td>\n<td>基金会深度介入了第一防线学校的学生失踪案，但事态走向超出预期，目前基金会仍束手无策。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>女人似乎察觉到了什么，她向着洋葱头藏身之地望了一眼，随后离开了这个地方。<br />\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"路边有一本遗落的笔记\">\n<p>那是一本羊皮封面的笔记，上面写着《第一防线学生守则》。<br />\n<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_3054_gamepic_11.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory 3054 gamepic 11.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/Rolestory_3054_gamepic_11.png/110px-Rolestory_3054_gamepic_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"104\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/Rolestory_3054_gamepic_11.png/165px-Rolestory_3054_gamepic_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/Rolestory_3054_gamepic_11.png/220px-Rolestory_3054_gamepic_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"470\" data-file-height=\"444\" /></a><br />\n记者翻开了它。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“第一防线学校，圣洛夫基金会的下辖机构之一，为尚未成年的神秘学家提供教育，并通过特定的教育方式增进学生对于神秘学的认知……”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“形成良好、可控的价值体系。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>洋葱头：</b></span>“其中半数以上的毕业学员将会在基金会任职，多为一线调查员。”<br />\n<small style=\"color: #999;\">获取线索</small><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable center\" style=\"max-width:800px\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">《第一防线学生守则》<small>（线索7）</small>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第一防线学校是一所对神秘学家进行教育的学校，宗旨是服务于人类社会。\n</td>\n<td>第一防线学校并不是学校，而是一个监牢。这里使用特定方式改造学生，让他们自愿接受赴死的命运。\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>远方隐约传来了脚步声，此处已不能再待了。<br />\n</p>\n</div></div>\n记者侧身，溜向了休闲区。<br /></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "流行于世界-04"}}